  "releaseNotes": "'## [13.3.3-prerelease.1](https://github.com/dotnet/dotnet-operator-sdk/compare/v13.3.2...v13.3.3-prerelease.1) (2026-10-07)\n\n### Bug Fixes\n\n* **operator:** retry scope resync on transient re-list failures ([#1272](https://github.com/dotnet/dotnet-operator-sdk/issues/1272)) ([70e548e](https://github.com/dotnet/dotnet-operator-sdk/commit/70e548e2cb89c241276792232f8f45d17cd4bfa3)), closes [#1271](https://github.com/dotnet/dotnet-operator-sdk/issues/1271)\n\n### Dependencies\n\n* **ci:** update helm/kind-action action to v1.15.1 ([#1270](https://github.com/dotnet/dotnet-operator-sdk/issues/1270)) ([530e379](https://github.com/dotnet/dotnet-operator-sdk/commit/530e379ac119eca43dd65d04ff5e41c2819678e7))\n* **test:** remove unused source generator testing package ([#1273](https://github.com/dotnet/dotnet-operator-sdk/issues/1273)) ([debdb04](https://github.com/dotnet/dotnet-operator-sdk/commit/debdb047cc198d72ce2d392120ee9dbf77b4d493))\n'",
